{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-01-10 17:31:00', 'title': 'KING SOOPERS/CITY MARKET FILES UNFAIR LABOR PRACTICE CHARGES AGAINST UFCW LOCAL 7 FOR FAILURE TO MEET AND NEGOTIATE IN GOOD FAITH', 'text': 'DENVER, JAN. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TODAY, KING SOOPERS AND CITY MARKET FILED UNFAIR LABOR PRACTICE CHARGES AGAINST UFCW LOCAL 7 FOR REFUSING TO BARGAIN IN GOOD FAITH. ADDITIONALLY, LOCAL 7 TODAY REJECTED MEDIATION SERVICES TO HELP AID IN A PEACEFUL RESOLUTION.'}{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-01-10 13:46:00', 'title': 'AS OMICRON SURGES, KROGER HEALTH REACHES IMPORTANT MILESTONE IN VIRUS RESPONSE', 'text': 'CINCINNATI, JAN. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KROGER HEALTH, THE HEALTHCARE DIVISION OF THE KROGER CO. (NYSE:\xa0KR) FAMILY OF COMPANIES, TODAY ACHIEVED THE ADMINISTRATION OF ITS 10 MILLIONTH DOSE OF COVID-19 VACCINE. THIS NEWS COMES AS THE OMICRON VARIANT SURGES ACROSS THE COUNTRY AND KROGER HEALTH CONTINUES TO EXPAND ITS OPTIONS FOR THE DETECTION, PREVENTION AND TREATMENT OF COVID-19.'}